{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_158884c1c06613fbae3b1ea498ac501ce1122204075e3ceafef6cb79b45577d5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"lucasduys/forge@642c60b104f0 snapshot 6c3a4dda31584cbd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1854da4b5d85512d3be28a84f0af1de6263e298469cac7daaa929397a72e4045","slc_5712e0661781ea4da6838f06546e31cf84c2806a736fb73e7add7115a31083a3","slc_d087cc73e56f3bb725082870a9506fe136bb2f2ccf31634d12e1d95807465b81"],"source_ids":["src_620021a5afdd50f68892029b6179b221","src_7c798626c2b65109885d832c1564a228"],"text":"Forge requires Claude Code v1.0.33+; the solo path needs no npm install, and Ably is an optional dependency only for multiplayer collaboration.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3242efdd939c21cc39092d49baed1aa494578b6fcb95023d79531923b623a84e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"lucasduys/forge@642c60b104f0 snapshot 6c3a4dda31584cbd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_17049a3381b81b52090bfbef4a564b986224a3dcbacb68e0993d08bf7d55744b","slc_387790518f2f20305a44504ac3f5c66359744e252610d2a571c0c0bcddb01dd7"],"source_ids":["src_7c798626c2b65109885d832c1564a228","src_f89e15189e6b5c848c932a9b2ccc1488"],"text":"The docs report measured token-savings results for the product's optimization filters, including a real A/B run where filtering a git diff cut Claude token use from 59,600 to 42,402 (28.9% fewer), and caveman compression benchmarks of 26.8% prose reduction.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4466f295dd87052bbb8e2612d5e6539d4107514e336d52c9fb64ccd51145bb7e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"lucasduys/forge@642c60b104f0 snapshot 6c3a4dda31584cbd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_44ac48d664a6b0af5185e2b0eb19f70c0691162d24a710229bd58af6b22e19b2","slc_fbb3dcf3044486222414e9225341571d157bcba0a7b6465ed66c0cdc95c00c73"],"source_ids":["src_7c798626c2b65109885d832c1564a228"],"text":"In gated (default) mode Forge pauses before installing new dependencies or calling paid APIs; full mode assumes prior consent for those, but both modes require explicit approval to push to a remote and refuse destructive git ops unless the spec requests them.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4977431eac43653209ff0a689d311348494eb9135cbf0a43ea8e801e6828e2be","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"lucasduys/forge@642c60b104f0 snapshot 6c3a4dda31584cbd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2a684e90f6ac2013d31301cac1e1a9343f3bcf04a28587bedd11d475e6b79491","slc_832213210a379d209462c3875fd3d6602c2f83d94e74eb65168f82212b3aab57","slc_bc227dc44095549237b06691c6def453011502529b7991be13f5e86f775725ca"],"source_ids":["src_620021a5afdd50f68892029b6179b221"],"text":"Three cross-cutting skills run automatically across agents: Karpathy guardrails inlined into executor/reviewer/planner, graphify knowledge-graph integration, and DESIGN.md design-system support — the latter two degrade gracefully when their inputs are absent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_588e39db7c286b8c93bb7da4fa10d054f0796c34c399e4070238090e7e917fca","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"lucasduys/forge@642c60b104f0 snapshot 6c3a4dda31584cbd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2e499878c94507214126a64b1e58339c21b1ed38e37fefbbee0408165f599c00","slc_571b1b289de7776926b2fa5947aa4cbbedbd20fbb438d918011e54fb8ffa66b3"],"source_ids":["src_620021a5afdd50f68892029b6179b221","src_7c798626c2b65109885d832c1564a228"],"text":"The pipeline is strictly sequential (brainstorm → plan → execute), enforced programmatically via an approval gate, frontier validation, and validateWorkflowPrerequisites(); users cannot skip phases or bypass the approval gate.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_696ada2127727a365c79c22631e5bfa307de7a143e6ae6eb0aa5e0e4aff4e957","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"lucasduys/forge@642c60b104f0 snapshot 6c3a4dda31584cbd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_36a591e48b65652c0bf4f617ffc273b45fd044bc2cbce55cc13f075c45491683","slc_73fa268f114b2f4b00df12db4127bdc3e0a1734d7b9d21da6c31a3ff041f4af4","slc_e7f3dcc3b564eb2958f5c976994724d6e726f29a93e2b207c10949b909bf907d"],"source_ids":["src_620021a5afdd50f68892029b6179b221","src_7c798626c2b65109885d832c1564a228"],"text":"Tasks execute in their own git worktrees with TDD, and passing tasks are squash-merged atomically; a streaming topological scheduler dispatches tasks as soon as their dependencies complete.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_74e177d8ffb796d82c7a26823ea64e1acb904ef33835517ff19c10900941513a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"lucasduys/forge@642c60b104f0 snapshot 6c3a4dda31584cbd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6e45e094bd53648135ff369bfa1381e5dc66bf2133b658e5430c72e9226425bf"],"source_ids":["src_7c798626c2b65109885d832c1564a228"],"text":"The docs acknowledge that FORGE_COMPLETE only means tasks done, tests green, reviewer and verifier satisfied; a feature passing all four can still look broken in a browser because unit tests don't render pixels.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_88ab7ddbabbfd84bd3c844bcbf6949ce082fd9147a997987816ddb136a6c5a6b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"lucasduys/forge@642c60b104f0 snapshot 6c3a4dda31584cbd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_f692596da5b878f86bd535aef0c22288f42fb58186ef696964a03530566efd1f"],"source_ids":["src_7c798626c2b65109885d832c1564a228"],"text":"Loop state lives on disk in a .forge directory rather than in the conversation, so crashes, context resets, and OOMs can recover by restarting the state machine from disk.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:08:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0024526ced714ac1b47b0f98e6b39691"}
